# plugin.py `_not_ported`, `pytest_collection_modifyitems` and `_count_declarations`: a do-not-port
# case is deselected (and counted) under every implementation but the origin.
src/mikemol/pytestspec/plugin.py|origin-deselects-do-not-port|impl != adapters\.ORIGIN|impl == adapters.ORIGIN|def=_not_ported
src/mikemol/pytestspec/plugin.py|every-other-disposition-deselected|and item\.disposition\.kind == DO_NOT_PORT|and item.disposition.kind != DO_NOT_PORT|def=_not_ported
src/mikemol/pytestspec/plugin.py|nothing-deselected|if dropped:|if False:|def=pytest_collection_modifyitems
src/mikemol/pytestspec/plugin.py|deselected-items-kept|items\[:\] = \[item for item in items if not _not_ported\(item, impl\)\]|pass|def=pytest_collection_modifyitems
src/mikemol/pytestspec/plugin.py|deselection-not-reported|config\.hook\.pytest_deselected\(items=dropped\)|pass|def=pytest_collection_modifyitems
src/mikemol/pytestspec/plugin.py|declarations-uncounted|if kind in \{DO_NOT_PORT, PORT_FIX\}:|if False:|def=_count_declarations
src/mikemol/pytestspec/plugin.py|skipped-cases-uncounted|counts\[DECLARED_SKIPPED\] \+= 1|pass|def=_count_declarations
